B.J4=s(["Get a Clone to your opponent's side of the board and you can trade it in \u2014 for a piece of yours that your opponent has previously captured. Not theirs; only your own losses come back this way.","This Clone is one step from the zone, and an Omni is already waiting in reserve from an earlier capture. Move it forward and choose."],t.s)
B.J5=s([2.59,11.33,14.37],t.n)
B.J7=s(['Near the center, the Vector\'s jump has one exception. When its two-space run lands exactly on the pole, "one space to the side" means a quarter turn of the whole board \u2014 six wedges \u2014 instead of one.',"From here, the two squares closest to the pole among the highlighted destinations are that special quarter-turn landing. Everything else is the Vector's ordinary jump shapes."],t.s)
